Z||000007||Cooter||08-18-99||10:00 PM||||My buddy Bob (who got me started into Fieros) bought his fastback GT car from a soldier that was getting shipped out for $500!!!!! The car is in PERFECT condition except the fact that the owner painted over the original red paint with spray can black primer - No one knows why. I missed out on an 88 formula for $600 that is in pretty good shape. Keep looking- there are others. I found an 88 formula with t-tops on the net for $2800 that needs paint- but it is on one end of the country and I am on the other. Beware of buying a wrecked car, I fix wrecks and will tell you that they are never as easy to fix as what you think they will be.
