Z||000011||ChadMan||08-19-99||11:49 AM||||My $0.02:  If you're willing to look long and hard enough, you'll find a better deal.<p>But IF the GT you're looking at doesn't have any frame damage, and IF everything else including the interior really is "nearly mint," and IF the mileage is reasonable, and IF it runs great, and IF you already have good body panels ready to bolt on, I say print this thread, show it to the guy and see if he'll take $1700, then buy it!
